  "content": "\n\n![banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4f75d5e09c35c7a967b5142223b3f4bb76021a43.png)\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">\n  <a title=\"Blueprint\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blueprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftinyurl.com%2Fycyjpbeb&n=-1\" alt=\"需要 Blueprint\"></a>\n  <a title=\"Discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/6uRtghgWnE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/780149719611473930?color=526557&amp;label=%20&amp;labelColor=54ab6b&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a>\n  <a title=\"Github\" href=\"https://github.com/rosevcook/windswept\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-Team_Galena?label=&amp;color=b68e45&amp;labelColor=ba472b&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Github 團隊\"></a>\n</p>\n<h3>📖 關於：</h3>\n<ul><li>《Windswept》是一款風格貼近原版（Vanilla-esque）的模組，大幅擴展了遊戲中的寒冷地區。它新增了苔原、松林荒原、栗木森林、薰衣草田與繁花草原等新生物群系，並加入新花卉、敵對生物等大量內容——基本上全是與冬季相關的豐富素材！</li></ul>\n<h3>📖 跨模組內容：</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/caverns-and-chasms\">Caverns & Chasms</a> - 銅色仙光、凍結肉塊、寒冷環境會生成裝備銀甲的生物、乾燥苔蘚鵝卵石磚／瓦片</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/create\">Create</a> - 蜂蜜／巧克力木桶</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/berry-good\">Berry Good</a> - 野生漿果種子</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/boatload\">Boatload</a> - 新增樹木類型對應的船隻變體</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/gallery\">Gallery</a> - 全部 7 幅繪畫的物品紋理</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/endergetic\">The Endergetic Expansion</a> - 終界仙光</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/quark\">Quark</a> - 新增樹木類型對應的木質方塊變體</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/woodworks\">Woodworks</a> - 新增樹木類型對應的木質方塊變體、所有木質方塊的鋸木機配方</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>📖 附加模組：</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>想要 Farmer's Delight 的相容支援？我們有專屬的擴充模組 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/windswept-delights\">Windswept Delights</a></li>\n  <p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4c86b8d891d9f5d0e9cfdc7107650064397368fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"228\"></p>\n</ul>",
